Open Windows programs: start known ones, set up unknown ones

Usage: easyplay open [OPTIONS] [FILES]...

Arguments:
  [FILES]...  Programs to open

Options:
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
